description:
Write a `Queue` class that keeps a `first` and a `last` index, so adding and removing never move other elements:

- `Queue.new()`, `q:push(v)`, `q:pop()` (the oldest value, or `nil` when empty), `q:peek()`, `q:size()` and `q:isEmpty()`;
- `pop` sets the old slot to `nil`, so the value can be collected;
- pushing `false` works (it is a real value, not "empty").
